      "detailed_description": "&quot;Disappearance - Takeshi. You were right. That Abandoned Village is Too Bad&quot; is a first-person horror-comedy game in which you search an abandoned Japanese village for your missing best friend.<br><br>Note: This game cannot be played in English. All languages in the game are Japanese.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>His best friend &quot;Hikaru,&quot; who does not listen to him, ignores the advice of the protagonist &quot;Takeshi&quot; and heads for the cursed abandoned village of &quot;Matsuzawa Village,&quot; where he goes missing.<br><br>Bizarre events attack Takeshi, who is assigned to search for Hikaru.<br><br>Can you survive in the face of an urban legend that seems quite serious?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contents</h2>The game is an &quot;action adventure&quot; in which you explore the field from a first-person perspective.<br><br>The objective of the game is to solve the mystery based on clues hidden in the abandoned village and find out the whereabouts of his best friend Hikaru.<br><br>Playing time: about 30 minutes<br>Number of endings: 1<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Game Live Streaming</h2>Game Live Streaming is welcome!<br>No advance notice is required for distribution.<br><br>If you would like to support us, please include the game title and Steam store URL in the summary section of your video. <br>It will be a great encouragement for our activities!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credit</h2>Trailer BGM<br>Music(title): tsudzumi-japan3<br>Music provided by SHW",
